coi

Maybe the main concern is actually "How to spread out the language so that 
I have many people to speak/learn/make errors with?"...
I don't have stats on Lojban usage, but it seems rather a niche (correct me 
if I'm wrong). And maybe this is what you feel when you ask if language is 
learnable.
I feel like the small dispersion is the main drawback of the language, 
unfortunately. Lojban is obviously worth more Lojbanists! ;)

co'o

